  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Slice cucumber into thin sticks. In a shallow bowl, combine the white wine vinegar and a good pinch of sugar and salt. Add cucumber to pickling liquid. Add enough water to just cover cucumber. Set aside.\n• Finely chop brown onion and garlic. Roughly chop tomato and spinach. Drain and rinse chickpeas.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/645395373aca9a284c0c4315/step-c1bb0e46.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook onion until softened, 4-5 mins.\n• Stir in the butter, garlic, Mexican seasoning and tomato paste. Cook until fragrant, 1 min. Add chickpeas, the water and vegetable stock powder. Reduce heat to medium and simmer until thickened, 3 mins.\n• Lightly mash chickpeas until slightly broken up and sauce has thickened. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/645395373aca9a284c0c4315/step-7ef5bf78.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, combine tomato, spinach, a drizzle of olive oil and a splash of pickling liquid in a medium bowl.\n• Season to taste and set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/645395373aca9a284c0c4315/step-7612c51c.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Microwave mini flour tortillas on a plate for 10 second bursts, until warmed through.\n• Drain pickled cucumber. Build tacos by spreading tortillas with mayo then topping with chickpeas, tomato salsa, cucumber and Cheddar cheese.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/645395373aca9a284c0c4315/step-bd23d444.jpg"
    }
  ]
